<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Chest for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>The best chest option available is the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> chest, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56563/twilight-scale-chestguard">
<img alt="Twilight Scale Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_raidshaman_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Scale Chestguard</span></a>.<br/>
