<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Wrist for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>There are not many options for this slot, with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63486/shackles-of-the-betrayed">
