<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Feet for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>The best feet option available are the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62363/earthmenders-boots">
