<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-elemental-shaman-dps">Off Hands for Elemental Shaman DPS</h4>While you can also use off-hands, we recommend using shields as the competition is lower and you will get free armor along with the usual throughput stats.<br/>
<br/>
